WEBVTT

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:18.990
Wh-what happened?

00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:24.890
Jeez! Wait up, Kaito!

00:00:26.310 --> 00:00:27.640
Not in your dreams!

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:29.980
Hey! I said to wait up!

00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:31.480
Kaito!

00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:33.650
What is this...?

00:00:33.650 --> 00:00:36.360
What am I seeing?

00:00:37.610 --> 00:00:39.970
Us... from ages ago?!

00:00:40.990 --> 00:00:47.120
Could this be akin to the illusionary
world Kaito told us about...?

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:48.680
Indeed, it is.

00:00:51.870 --> 00:00:52.830
Jin!

00:00:52.830 --> 00:00:55.130
Welcome to Amgine.

00:00:55.130 --> 00:01:00.760
Or rather, to my world, Phi-Brain children.

00:01:01.510 --> 00:01:03.590
Then he’s--?!

00:01:05.090 --> 00:01:06.460
Orpheus!

00:01:07.430 --> 00:01:12.560
There’s no escape ‘cause
I’m now believing my fate so there’s no runaway

00:02:38.030 --> 00:02:42.010
It’s Okay If I Can’t Solve Puzzles

00:02:44.360 --> 00:02:49.020
I can see you clearly knew we
were one our way to Amgine.

00:02:49.490 --> 00:02:51.660
What’re you up to, Orpheus?!

00:02:51.660 --> 00:02:55.660
What do you hope to gain by
showing this crap to us?!

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:02.530
That’s an...!

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:06.300
As you have rejected the Armlet of Orpheus,

00:03:06.800 --> 00:03:10.760
allow me to show you the extent
of a Phi-Brain’s power!

00:03:20.560 --> 00:03:22.850
Where the blazes is this...?

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:38.690
Aren’t they...

00:03:39.460 --> 00:03:41.490
Kaito’s mom and dad?

00:03:42.500 --> 00:03:43.540
You bastard!

00:03:47.260 --> 00:03:48.660
Stop it!

00:03:53.760 --> 00:03:56.500
Dad! Mom!

00:04:03.020 --> 00:04:05.690
Wait, Dad! Mom!

00:04:06.940 --> 00:04:08.240
Kaito?!

00:04:08.240 --> 00:04:09.470
You can’t come with us!

00:04:10.070 --> 00:04:12.730
This is a puzzle! It’s a PUZZLE!

00:04:13.370 --> 00:04:15.480
So I’m going with you.

00:04:49.690 --> 00:04:51.310
Thank you, Kaito!

00:04:52.740 --> 00:04:55.120
There's no puzzle I can't solve!

00:04:55.120 --> 00:04:56.160
Kaito!

00:04:56.160 --> 00:04:57.270
Kaito!

00:04:57.990 --> 00:05:01.030
I can’t breathe, Dad! Mom!

00:05:02.960 --> 00:05:05.470
Dad... Mom...

00:05:06.630 --> 00:05:08.530
Pull yourself together, Kaito!

00:05:27.400 --> 00:05:29.050
M-Mama...

00:05:39.910 --> 00:05:42.960
Hey! Wait for me, Freecell!

00:05:47.420 --> 00:05:49.570
I’ll have you know that’s my pendant!

00:05:51.210 --> 00:05:53.760
Too bad! I want it!

00:05:54.260 --> 00:05:56.580
Really! I can’t tell you “no.”

00:05:58.300 --> 00:05:59.580
She isn’t wearing a Ring!

00:06:06.100 --> 00:06:07.270
How do you like it?

00:06:08.810 --> 00:06:10.730
Thank you, Mama!

00:06:10.900 --> 00:06:13.110
I’m the one who should be thanking you.

00:06:14.190 --> 00:06:16.360
You may not remember this,

00:06:17.160 --> 00:06:20.150
but when they were about to put
the Orpheus Ring on me,

00:06:20.620 --> 00:06:22.860
you started to bawl your little head off.

00:06:23.830 --> 00:06:28.880
And that’s when it hit me:
This is dangerous! I mustn’t put it on!

00:06:30.960 --> 00:06:35.380
I’m able to happily enjoy life now
all because you protected me.

00:06:35.930 --> 00:06:38.090
Thank you, Freecell.

00:06:44.230 --> 00:06:45.230
Mama...

00:06:52.900 --> 00:06:56.420
By interfering with the past,
I can change the future.

00:06:56.740 --> 00:06:59.890
This is the true power of a Phi-Brain.

00:07:00.070 --> 00:07:02.900
I won’t buy that you can
mess around with the past!

00:07:03.450 --> 00:07:05.080
This is all bullshit!

00:07:05.080 --> 00:07:07.750
I just don’t know the trick behind it!

00:07:07.750 --> 00:07:08.650
Really?

00:07:09.830 --> 00:07:12.250
Darn it! I can’t solve puzzles!

00:07:14.380 --> 00:07:17.300
What’s it take to solve
them like you, Kaito?

00:07:19.300 --> 00:07:20.620
Guess!

00:07:21.550 --> 00:07:23.920
Hey, what am I supposed to do here?

00:07:24.390 --> 00:07:25.920
You’re so hopeless.

00:07:29.310 --> 00:07:30.170
I solved it!

00:07:30.600 --> 00:07:31.490
You did it!

00:07:31.980 --> 00:07:33.930
I solved a puzzle of my own!

00:07:34.570 --> 00:07:39.430
Solving puzzles feels really
great! I never knew!

00:07:39.910 --> 00:07:41.120
Uh-huh! Uh-huh!

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:43.010
Puzzles are so fun!

00:07:43.010 --> 00:07:45.140
Keep teaching me how to solve them, Kaito!

00:07:45.450 --> 00:07:49.330
Nope! From now on,
you’ve gotta solve them by yourself.

00:07:49.330 --> 00:07:49.940
Huh?

00:07:50.540 --> 00:07:54.570
Challenge harder and harder puzzles
and solve them on your own!

00:07:55.210 --> 00:07:57.840
You’ll have loads more fun that way!

00:07:58.470 --> 00:07:59.450
Really...?

00:08:00.090 --> 00:08:02.640
Nonoha solved a puzzle...?

00:08:03.890 --> 00:08:06.640
How long are you gonna make
us watch this stupid show?!

00:08:07.270 --> 00:08:09.460
You’re wrong. This isn’t...

00:08:15.590 --> 00:08:19.600
Itou Residence

00:08:18.150 --> 00:08:19.600
Hello, this is the Daimon residence.

00:08:21.360 --> 00:08:23.820
Yes, right...

00:08:24.860 --> 00:08:25.600
What?!

00:08:28.250 --> 00:08:30.710
Kaito, Nonoha is...!

00:08:36.420 --> 00:08:37.120
Nonoha!

00:08:37.840 --> 00:08:38.920
Kaito...

00:08:38.920 --> 00:08:40.340
Are you all right?

00:08:40.340 --> 00:08:41.850
Nonoha, what happened?

00:08:44.260 --> 00:08:47.000
I got a tummy ache after I ate too much.

00:08:47.810 --> 00:08:49.020
Oomph.

00:08:49.640 --> 00:08:51.060
Are you all better?

00:08:51.060 --> 00:08:53.270
Well... nuh-huh.

00:08:54.770 --> 00:08:57.320
I forgot how to solve the puzzle...

00:08:57.520 --> 00:08:58.570
What?!

00:08:58.570 --> 00:09:01.110
And here you taught me how!

00:09:02.780 --> 00:09:05.080
D-don’t let that get to you!

00:09:05.410 --> 00:09:08.900
I’ll solve ALL of the
puzzles for you, Nonoha.

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:10.900
Really?

00:09:11.410 --> 00:09:13.170
Uh-huh! It’s a promise!

00:09:13.170 --> 00:09:15.850
So get well soon, Nonoha!

00:09:16.290 --> 00:09:17.040
’Kay!

00:09:19.630 --> 00:09:25.410
Cross your heart, hope to die,
stick a thousand needles in your eye!

00:09:26.140 --> 00:09:27.630
It’s a pinky promise!

00:09:26.140 --> 00:09:30.180
I loved watching you solve puzzles, Kaito.

00:09:31.600 --> 00:09:35.060
I wanted to watch you solve them
forever and ever and ever.

00:09:35.520 --> 00:09:37.980
But then you said you wouldn’t
let me watch anymore.

00:09:38.360 --> 00:09:41.190
It made me sad and lonesome...

00:09:41.780 --> 00:09:43.930
So I ate my heart out!

00:09:44.410 --> 00:09:47.940
I think that’s when I truly stopped
being able to solve puzzles.

00:09:48.370 --> 00:09:51.290
I had completely forgotten about this memory.

00:09:51.830 --> 00:09:55.440
No, I had put it out of my mind.

00:09:55.790 --> 00:09:58.840
It’s a memory you had
put out of your mind...?

00:09:59.420 --> 00:10:01.200
Then what is this...?

00:10:05.430 --> 00:10:10.260
Without a doubt, what you
have seen were your pasts.

00:10:10.600 --> 00:10:15.710
And by interfering with those pasts,
I have altered those worlds.

00:10:17.350 --> 00:10:19.880
However, I am not yet perfect.

00:10:20.670 --> 00:10:26.260
I am only able to let you see your
true past and recreated realities.

00:10:26.530 --> 00:10:30.070
But if I become a perfect Phi-Brain,

00:10:30.070 --> 00:10:34.580
I will transcend time, obtaining power
that surpasses that of the gods.

00:10:35.290 --> 00:10:38.990
The power to interact with
the past to change reality!

00:10:40.290 --> 00:10:42.380
If you had realized all it entailed,

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:46.770
would you still have cast your Armlets aside?

00:10:47.180 --> 00:10:48.710
These Armlets select those

00:10:48.710 --> 00:10:52.880
worthy to serve as my vessel
and forges contracts with them.

00:10:53.720 --> 00:10:55.500
That is what they were made for.

00:10:55.810 --> 00:10:56.980
What?!

00:10:56.980 --> 00:11:00.140
By wearing the Armlet,
the bearer’s emotions are scraped off.

00:11:00.690 --> 00:11:03.350
It forcibly releases the
bearer’s brain to the limits,

00:11:03.670 --> 00:11:06.390
encouraging him to develop as a Phi-Brain.

00:11:07.110 --> 00:11:08.500
Now take this.

00:11:08.950 --> 00:11:14.770
As you are now, you should become Phi-Brains
shortly upon donning the Armlet.

00:11:15.540 --> 00:11:17.540
You have the capacity!

00:11:18.040 --> 00:11:20.540
That is something countless
geniuses yearned for,

00:11:20.540 --> 00:11:22.400
but could never obtain!

00:11:22.400 --> 00:11:24.580
They lacked the capacity to surpass the gods!

00:11:26.260 --> 00:11:28.070
You just wanna turn Kaito and Freecell into

00:11:28.070 --> 00:11:30.190
Phi-Brains so you can steal their bodies!

00:11:30.190 --> 00:11:32.420
I won’t let you do that!

00:11:32.720 --> 00:11:38.420
I may need their bodies, but I have no
intention of stealing their lives.

00:11:39.980 --> 00:11:41.180
What do you mean by that?

00:11:41.770 --> 00:11:46.890
As you are well aware,
Jin Makata’s mind has not vanished.

00:11:47.530 --> 00:11:48.680
It is right here.

00:11:49.450 --> 00:11:54.030
Phi-Brain children, all I ask is that you
accept my mind into yourselves

00:11:54.330 --> 00:11:59.510
and lend me five years--no,
one year of your lives.

00:12:00.040 --> 00:12:00.960
One year?

00:12:01.310 --> 00:12:03.570
What do you hope to
accomplish in a measly year?

00:12:04.130 --> 00:12:06.520
Having been born on this world,

00:12:06.520 --> 00:12:09.730
you must challenge the gods and surpass them!

00:12:10.470 --> 00:12:12.830
That is the path mankind is meant to follow.

00:12:13.470 --> 00:12:17.020
Make your choice, Phi-Brain children!

00:12:17.390 --> 00:12:20.170
Do not make me waste my time.

00:12:20.770 --> 00:12:26.350
If I so chose, it would be no effort at all for
me to erase Jin Makata’s mind.

00:12:27.190 --> 00:12:30.470
If I became a Phi-Brain, I can save Jin!

00:12:30.860 --> 00:12:32.520
And that’s not all!

00:12:33.160 --> 00:12:34.190
I could change the past.

00:12:34.530 --> 00:12:36.080
I could save Mom and Dad!

00:12:37.040 --> 00:12:38.460
And then I could...

00:12:57.100 --> 00:12:58.560
Kaito!

00:12:58.850 --> 00:13:00.350
Hey, Kaito!

00:13:02.730 --> 00:13:04.900
Oh! Good morning, Nonoha.

00:13:05.190 --> 00:13:07.780
Don’t “Good morning!” me! Sheesh!

00:13:07.980 --> 00:13:09.690
Here, take it! It’s your lunch.

00:13:09.690 --> 00:13:11.400
You forgot it AGAIN!

00:13:11.400 --> 00:13:12.400
Oopsy!

00:13:12.400 --> 00:13:14.230
That poor lunch your mom
packed is gonna start crying!

00:13:14.660 --> 00:13:18.860
I get it, I get it! I’m just preoccupied
with last minute cramming.

00:13:19.330 --> 00:13:21.750
Is the puzzle championship coming up soon?

00:13:21.750 --> 00:13:25.710
Yeah! I’m totally gonna take
home first place this year!

00:13:26.170 --> 00:13:28.120
I’m gonna win the All-Japan
Puzzle Championship!

00:13:29.840 --> 00:13:33.000
Nope, nope! I’m going to win
this year’s championship.

00:13:33.260 --> 00:13:34.310
Freecell!

00:13:35.050 --> 00:13:37.190
You can get the same
place you get every year,

00:13:37.600 --> 00:13:39.510
Forever-Third Kaito.

00:13:40.470 --> 00:13:44.600
Shut up! This is the year I’m
going to defeat both of you!

00:13:44.980 --> 00:13:47.040
Oh? I look forward to seeing you try.

00:13:48.230 --> 00:13:53.390
Try as you two might,
I will still come out in first again this year.

00:13:53.700 --> 00:13:54.490
Rook!

00:13:56.030 --> 00:13:59.400
I won’t let you get away with boasting like that forever,
Mr. Student Council President!

00:13:59.740 --> 00:14:03.150
Class is about to start! Run!

00:14:03.790 --> 00:14:05.620
It’s the principal and Mr. Makata.

00:14:06.290 --> 00:14:07.460
Jin!

00:14:08.380 --> 00:14:11.200
I’m looking forward to your training session
at the Puzzle Club after school today!

00:14:11.710 --> 00:14:15.970
Hey, Kaito! Didn’t I tell you to call
me “Mr. Makata” at school?

00:14:17.720 --> 00:14:22.350
If you became a Phi-Brain, you
could make this a reality.

00:14:31.480 --> 00:14:34.240
You could also erase your painful past...

00:14:39.370 --> 00:14:41.370
If you became a Phi-Brain...

00:14:46.540 --> 00:14:49.270
If I became a Phi-Brain...

00:15:08.850 --> 00:15:09.940
Wanna give it a shot?

00:15:09.940 --> 00:15:11.510
Eh? You sure?

00:15:11.770 --> 00:15:13.780
I wonder if I can do it...

00:15:14.780 --> 00:15:15.690
This is wrong...

00:15:17.530 --> 00:15:19.520
This is WRONG!

00:15:21.180 --> 00:15:23.040
Wake up!

00:15:24.120 --> 00:15:26.140
Round 2!

00:15:27.460 --> 00:15:28.710
Crush!

00:15:35.300 --> 00:15:37.010
Ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:15:37.010 --> 00:15:38.910
What was that for, Nonoha?!

00:15:39.340 --> 00:15:42.420
Those images weren’t showing the real us!

00:15:42.640 --> 00:15:43.570
What?!

00:15:43.970 --> 00:15:46.210
Sure enough, we can’t change the past!

00:15:46.680 --> 00:15:48.550
We may have been through a lot,

00:15:48.550 --> 00:15:50.920
but we’re who we are now because of our pasts!

00:15:51.400 --> 00:15:54.410
I got to meet you, Kaito, and you, Freecell,

00:15:54.410 --> 00:15:56.430
because of everything that’s happened!

00:15:58.240 --> 00:15:59.260
Nonoha...

00:16:00.240 --> 00:16:03.310
It’s okay if I can’t solve puzzles!

00:16:03.780 --> 00:16:05.840
It doesn’t upset me any!

00:16:06.410 --> 00:16:11.160
Just getting to see Kaito and
everyone else solve puzzles...

00:16:11.160 --> 00:16:12.820
That alone makes me happy!

00:16:14.210 --> 00:16:16.830
Thank you, little me from back then.

00:16:18.130 --> 00:16:21.330
Because of what happened,
Kaito is still a puzzle-loving fanatic.

00:16:22.550 --> 00:16:23.830
Shut it!

00:16:28.180 --> 00:16:29.340
Mama...

00:16:29.890 --> 00:16:32.760
Nonoha, it’s as you said.

00:16:33.900 --> 00:16:35.470
I’m here because of that past...

00:16:37.780 --> 00:16:38.610
Yeah!

00:16:39.360 --> 00:16:41.350
The memories we share with everyone--

00:16:43.330 --> 00:16:46.730
They’re what make us
who we are now, Orpheus!

00:16:49.290 --> 00:16:52.130
I’ve made my mind. I’m
not gonna become a Phi-Brain!

00:16:52.750 --> 00:16:53.490
What?

00:16:54.380 --> 00:16:55.550
Changing the past?

00:16:56.080 --> 00:16:58.370
That’s an ability I can live without!

00:17:00.300 --> 00:17:03.180
Mankind is meant to follow
a path to surpass the gods?

00:17:03.680 --> 00:17:05.620
To hell with that!

00:17:07.930 --> 00:17:11.770
Orpheus, I won’t let you have your way!

00:17:12.100 --> 00:17:15.610
I will defeat you! And save Jin!

00:17:16.150 --> 00:17:18.150
Do you think you can do that?

00:17:18.730 --> 00:17:21.390
You bet! There’s no puzzle...

00:17:21.950 --> 00:17:24.190
I can’t solve!

00:17:36.880 --> 00:17:39.860
Are we... back?

00:17:45.430 --> 00:17:46.920
Kaito Daimon...

00:17:48.760 --> 00:17:50.960
You acted differently than foreseen,

00:17:50.960 --> 00:17:53.880
eliciting a different conclusion from the future I saw...

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:55.050
How fascinating!

00:17:56.840 --> 00:18:01.160
Does this imply the future is filled
with undetermined elements?

00:18:02.400 --> 00:18:03.950
Then so be it.

00:18:05.570 --> 00:18:08.030
Enigma, how is its progress?

00:18:08.870 --> 00:18:10.830
I take it you’re referring
to the Puzzle of God?

00:18:14.920 --> 00:18:16.900
The operations are running smoothly.

00:18:17.500 --> 00:18:18.760
Glad to hear it.

00:18:20.800 --> 00:18:21.660
Jin!

00:18:22.510 --> 00:18:25.300
The strain... was too great...

00:18:28.760 --> 00:18:29.920
Jin!

00:18:30.690 --> 00:18:32.800
Jin, hang in there!

00:18:37.150 --> 00:18:39.190
Man, that shocked me!

00:18:39.770 --> 00:18:44.070
I never expected him to show me a
memory I’d forgotten all about.

00:18:44.240 --> 00:18:45.930
Yeah, he surprised me as well.

00:18:46.990 --> 00:18:50.410
So a Phi-Brain can transcend time, huh?

00:18:51.290 --> 00:18:52.580
But one thing puzzles me...

00:18:52.580 --> 00:18:53.190
Huh?

00:18:53.750 --> 00:18:55.620
It’s something Orpheus said.

00:18:56.580 --> 00:19:01.240
What did he mean when he claimed he
only needed our bodies for a year?

00:19:03.090 --> 00:19:06.010
Why is Orpheus so impatient?

00:19:07.430 --> 00:19:08.960
Let’s put more ants in his pants!

00:19:14.980 --> 00:19:18.150
Let’s go! I’m gonna hit up
those puzzles he’s prepared!

00:19:18.350 --> 00:19:20.650
I’ll solve any puzzle he’s got laid out

00:19:20.980 --> 00:19:23.970
and blow all of his plans to smithereens!

00:19:24.190 --> 00:19:25.170
Kaito!

00:19:25.490 --> 00:19:26.990
Yeah, let’s go!

00:19:33.660 --> 00:19:37.250
Without Kaito and crew,
the academy is pleasantly quiet!

00:19:38.040 --> 00:19:41.140
But there’s no way I can stick around, huh?

00:19:42.420 --> 00:19:45.260
Not after “Mr.” Orpheus picked me out.

00:19:46.380 --> 00:19:47.380
Galileo.

00:19:47.380 --> 00:19:48.000
Huh?

00:19:49.840 --> 00:19:51.020
Antoinette?!

00:19:51.390 --> 00:19:54.000
Tada! Tickets to Amgine!

00:19:54.350 --> 00:19:55.430
You--!

00:19:56.230 --> 00:19:59.260
Not going? We both know better.

00:20:01.310 --> 00:20:04.280
Sheeit, Mistress Erena!

00:20:16.200 --> 00:20:17.540
Are you all right?

00:20:19.120 --> 00:20:22.030
Yeah, I’m fine.

00:20:22.590 --> 00:20:25.090
Jin! You’re Jin, aren’t you?

00:20:26.050 --> 00:20:27.920
You’ve had me worried sick!

00:20:27.920 --> 00:20:30.130
I thought you wouldn’t come back to me!

00:20:31.340 --> 00:20:32.560
I’m sorry...

00:20:33.640 --> 00:20:36.730
This is wonderful... Truly wonderful!

00:20:37.350 --> 00:20:40.270
But my time is limited.

00:20:40.900 --> 00:20:44.090
I can only remain myself for a little while.

00:20:44.900 --> 00:20:47.310
Raetsel, keep away from me.

00:20:48.070 --> 00:20:51.160
Have Kaito and the others do likewise.
They must not get near me!

00:20:51.160 --> 00:20:51.930
What?

00:20:52.160 --> 00:20:55.830
You must not give Orpheus a new body.

00:20:56.370 --> 00:21:00.470
If he remains in this body,
eventually he will perish!

00:21:01.120 --> 00:21:04.200
Wh-what are you saying, Jin?

00:21:04.750 --> 00:21:08.340
I’ve reached my limit. This
body’s at it’s end...

00:21:08.340 --> 00:21:11.330
No! Tell me that’s a lie, Jin!

00:21:11.970 --> 00:21:14.900
When I go, I’ll take Orpheus down with me.

00:21:16.680 --> 00:21:18.340
So, Raetsel...

00:21:18.890 --> 00:21:23.100
No, Jin! Don’t say things like that!

00:21:23.350 --> 00:21:25.720
I’ll figure something out!

00:21:26.570 --> 00:21:30.780
Indeed? Then would you become a Phi-Brain?

00:21:33.990 --> 00:21:36.240
I will take anyone.

00:21:38.080 --> 00:21:41.000
In order to become the perfect Phi-Brain,

00:21:41.580 --> 00:21:46.500
the concept of sacrificing all of mankind
does not concern me in the least.

00:21:48.460 --> 00:21:51.970
It is all part of the puzzle
to surpass the gods!

00:22:08.150 --> 00:22:09.110
What is that...?

00:22:09.860 --> 00:22:12.970
The Puzzle of Trials that
Orpheus has prepared for us.

00:22:16.030 --> 00:22:19.680
Will you gain the ability to defeat Orpheus
if you solve all of his puzzles?

00:22:20.290 --> 00:22:23.410
Beats me! I’ll just have to give it a shot!

00:22:24.580 --> 00:22:27.160
Puzzle time... Let’s begin!

00:24:01.890 --> 00:24:05.060
Welcome to POG Air! I am your pilot, Bishop.

00:24:05.180 --> 00:24:06.960
We’ll be in the Republic of Amgine shortly!

00:24:07.430 --> 00:24:08.980
Please hang tight, Freecell!

00:24:08.980 --> 00:24:11.050
What?! Master Rook is...?!

00:24:11.480 --> 00:24:15.530
We have an emergency!
Our plane will be changing course to POG Japan!

00:24:15.690 --> 00:24:16.690
Say what?!

00:24:16.690 --> 00:24:18.770
Next time, “Because You Were Watching.”

00:24:16.740 --> 00:24:27.970
Because You Were Watching

00:24:19.240 --> 00:24:22.120
Socks are in the second drawer from the bottom,
Master Rook!

00:24:22.120 --> 00:24:24.870
Someone, please get me off this plane!

00:24:24.870 --> 00:24:27.080
Master Rook!

00:24:27.980 --> 00:24:30.990
Brainiac! Root Gakuen

00:24:27.980 --> 00:24:30.990
~Waiting Under the Philosopher’s Tree
Fin Art: Akeru Otsuki
